1)selection sort :

class Solution {
    public int[] selectionSort(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        for(int i=0;i<n-1;i++){
            int minIndex=i;
            for(int j=i+1;j<n;j++){
                if(nums[j]<nums[minIndex]){
                    minIndex=j;
                }
            }
            if(minIndex!=i){
                int temp = nums[minIndex];
                nums[minIndex]=nums[i];
                nums[i]=temp;
            }
        }
        return nums;
   }
}
Complexity:
Time Complexity: O(n²)
Best: O(n²)
Average: O(n²)
Worst: O(n²)
Space Complexity: O(1)
